title: Speaking Tour
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
view-if: speaking_tour_timer <= 0
on-arrival: speaking_tour_timer = 3; month_actions += 1

= Speaking Tour

You will spend the week on the road: town halls, factory gates, and the Conservative clubs of marginal seats. What is the message?

- @unions: The unions are running the country.
- @tax: Let people keep more of what they earn.
- @inflation: Inflation is the thief in every pay packet.
- @homes: A property-owning democracy.
- @order: Law, order and pride in Britain.
- @one_nation: One Nation: we govern for everyone.
- @easy_discard

@unions
on-arrival: union_backlash += 3; c2_con += 3*(1-dissent) if union_backlash >= 55; c2_con += 2*(1-dissent) if policy_union_reform; de_lab += 1 if strike_wave < 3; wet_dissent += 3; dry_dissent -= 3

[? if strike_wave >= 4 : With picket lines on the evening news, the message lands hard. ?][? if strike_wave < 4 : While the industrial scene is quiet, some voters think we are picking a fight for its own sake. ?] Jim Prior winces at every speech.

@tax
on-arrival: c1_con += 3*(1-dissent); ab_con += 2*(1-dissent); c2_con += 2*(1-dissent) if policy_tax_cuts; economic_liberalism += 2

A basic rate of 33% and a top rate of 83% are easy targets. [? if policy_tax_cuts : Because tax cuts are now official policy, skilled workers take the promise seriously. ?]

@inflation
on-arrival: economic_liberalism += 3; c1_con += 2*(1-dissent); de_con += 2*(1-dissent) if inflation >= 10; dry_strength += 2

You explain to housewives and pensioners that inflation robs savers and wage-earners alike, and that governments cause it by printing money. [? if inflation < 10 : With inflation falling, the warning sounds abstract to many. ?]

@homes
view-if: policy_right_to_buy
on-arrival: c2_con += 4*(1-dissent); de_con += 3*(1-dissent)

Council tenants listen closely when you promise them the right to buy their homes at a discount.

@order
on-arrival: right_strength += 2; right_dissent -= 3; c2_con += 2*(1-dissent); de_con += 2*(1-dissent); c1_lib += 1; wet_dissent += 2

Crime, discipline and national pride go down well in the clubs. The Liberals say we are playing to fear.

@one_nation
on-arrival: wet_dissent -= 5; c1_con += 2*(1-dissent); dry_dissent += 3

You quote Disraeli and promise a government for the whole country. The wets are pleased; Keith Joseph wonders aloud what the point of winning is.
